---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Markdown from '../components/Markdown.astro';

const explainer = `
## About Jo1nTrX™

Welcome to Jo1nTrX™ - a multipurpose Discord bot designed to enhance your server experience.

### What is Jo1nTrX™?

Jo1nTrX™ is a feature-rich Discord bot that brings powerful tools and engaging features to your server, making community management easier and more fun.

### Key Features

- **Moderation**: Comprehensive tools to manage and moderate your server effectively
- **Invite & Message Tracking**: Keep track of server invites and message statistics
- **Fun & Games**: Entertaining games and activities to keep your community engaged
- **Currency Exchange**: Virtual economy system with user balances, transactions, and exchange records
- **Utility**: Helpful utility commands for various server needs
- **Welcomer**: Customizable welcome messages for new members
- **And Many More**: Constantly evolving with new features and improvements

### Game Statistics

Track scores, achievements, and progress in bot games and activities to create a competitive and engaging environment for your community.

### Our Mission

To provide Discord communities with a powerful, all-in-one bot solution that enhances server management and member engagement.
`;
---

<Layout title="About Jo1nTrX">
    <h1 class="mb-10">About Jo1nTrX</h1>
    <Markdown content={explainer} class="mb-10" />
</Layout>
